WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.610
- I'm obsessed with a video

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.460
I saw on Facebook recently.

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.120
It's a young girl who
got bullied for her hair,

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.120
and she wasn't having it.

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.094
Take a look.

00:00:08.094 --> 00:00:08.927
(whooshing)

00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:10.590
- So, yesterday, I went to school

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.570
and I wore my hair in a Afro, like this.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:16.740
And a lot of people had
a lot of mean things

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:17.990
to say about it.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.390
So, that made me feel some type of way.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.497
I told my mom and she said,

00:00:23.497 --> 00:00:25.570
"Promise, don't forget who you are,

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.170
and whose you are."

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.420
And I said, "okay."

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.700
So today, I'm gonna go to school

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.040
and I'm gonna come back bigger and better.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.450
And don't allow anyone to steal your joy.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.305
Don't give them that much power.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.605
- Oh my God.

00:00:40.605 --> 00:00:42.273
(crowd applauding and cheering)

00:00:42.273 --> 00:00:44.190
All right, I see you.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.070
Her name is Promise Sawyers,

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:48.200
she's only 10 years old,

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.100
but I want to make her my life coach,

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.450
'cause I love her.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.570
Promise is here along with her mother Qui.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.300
So, okay, Promise tell me what happened

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.530
when you got to school.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:58.670
- So, when I went to school,

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:00.520
I wore my hair in a Afro.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.930
And, a lot of people had a lot of

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:03.280
mean things to say about it,

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:06.530
and that really surprised me,
because at my other school,

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.000
everybody used to love it.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.790
They would say, Promise, I love your hair.

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:11.870
But when I went to this school,

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:16.030
everybody just had several
negative things to say about it.

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:16.863
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:16.863 --> 00:01:17.810
- That's mean.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:18.860
Kids can be mean.

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:20.651
Junior high sucked for me.

00:01:20.651 --> 00:01:21.820
(laughing)

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.500
It wasn't fun.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.550
But as moms, we try so
hard to protect our kids,

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:26.383
and I'm gonna be real with you.

00:01:26.383 --> 00:01:29.049
I probably would have
walked up to that school,

00:01:29.049 --> 00:01:30.256
I would not have handled that well.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.505
Maybe lost a couple jobs.

00:01:31.505 --> 00:01:32.770
I would not have handled that well.

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:34.020
'Cause it's your baby.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.180
Somebody's talking to your baby

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:36.440
and they don't even know your baby.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.030
They're just makin' fun of somethin'

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.810
that's maybe different
than what they're used to.

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:42.250
What'd you tell her when that happened?

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:43.770
- So, she came home, and of course

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:44.770
kind of expressed what happened.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.110
She was like, I'm feelin'
sad, I'm feelin' this,

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:49.570
and she kind of gave me
like a plethora of emotions.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.150
And admittedly, I wanted to defend,

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:53.750
and I'm like, no, no, no, Promise.

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.850
I had to stop her, we were
not having a pity party.

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:58.690
And I had to tell her, how
did you feel this morning?

00:01:58.690 --> 00:01:59.900
How did you feel when you walked out?

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.100
And she said, I felt confident,

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.290
I felt good, I felt great
about it, I felt cute.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:04.390
I'm like, okay, and she said,

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.590
but they said mean things
and they said this,

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:07.423
and then she just kept goin' in.

00:02:07.423 --> 00:02:09.710
I was like, no, no, no,
how do we feel about it?

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:11.590
And she said, I felt good.

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.716
And I said, that's all that matters.

00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:13.549
I said you're not going--

00:02:13.549 --> 00:02:16.541
(applause)

00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:18.182
- It's so great.

00:02:18.182 --> 00:02:21.320
So who had the idea to create the video?

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:24.600
- So we went, kind of like
the end of that conversation,

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.340
when I told her I said
we're not going to allow

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.770
what someone says to
dictate our entire day,

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:30.940
you can give it a little
moment, but not the entire day.

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:31.773
And so, she said okay.

00:02:31.773 --> 00:02:33.251
- [Kelly] You're such a good person.

00:02:33.251 --> 00:02:34.770
(laughing)

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:35.670
- It takes practice--

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:36.895
- Can you write a book?

00:02:36.895 --> 00:02:38.220
(laughing)

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.270
- And so, when she said
okay, it wasn't like,

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.170
okay I feel good about this,

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:43.890
it's kinda like, okay here's mom again.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.840
But the next morning, I'm
just brushing my teeth,

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.210
and she's like, where's your phone?

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:48.050
I'm like, okay.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.100
So, I came out from brushing my teeth

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.870
and just heard her saying those words.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.790
And I was like, that is my kid!

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:54.692
- Yeah, and I really--

00:02:54.692 --> 00:02:56.942
(applause)

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:00.580
- I'm so proud of you, that's so cool

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.090
that you flipped it, you
turned it into a positive,

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:04.510
you turned it into
confidence, I love that.

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:06.810
How did the kids react when
you went back the next day?

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.170
- They were kinda used to it,

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.400
but some people still were asking

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:11.726
why are you wearing your hair like that?

00:03:11.726 --> 00:03:12.559
I was like--

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:14.017
- Why are you wearing your hair like that?

00:03:14.017 --> 00:03:15.517
(laughing)

00:03:15.517 --> 00:03:17.260
That's what I would say.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.093
I love that.

00:03:18.093 --> 00:03:19.580
Your video though has
inspired so many people,

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:22.000
including my first guest y'all.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.340
She is a Golden Globe
award-winning actress,

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:25.870
and the star of "Black-ish."

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:26.810
The last time I saw her,

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.080
she was singing "A Moment Like This"

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.220
at the American Music
Awards, it was awesome.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.670
Say hello to Tracee Ellis Ross, thank you.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:33.846
(crowd cheering)

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:36.429
(upbeat music)

00:03:46.435 --> 00:03:47.944
- Look at you, oh my God.

00:03:47.944 --> 00:03:51.460
- Look at Promise, look at
Promise, look at Promise.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:52.897
- [Kelly] Oh!

00:03:52.897 --> 00:03:54.541
(crowd cheering)

00:03:54.541 --> 00:03:56.182
- That is so beautiful!

00:03:56.182 --> 00:03:57.457
- Promise, you're my dream!

00:03:57.457 --> 00:03:59.132
- Get up here!
- Promise, come here.

00:03:59.132 --> 00:04:00.315
- Get up here!
- Come here.

00:04:00.315 --> 00:04:02.273
- Come up here, yes!

00:04:02.273 --> 00:04:03.523
Give her a hug.

00:04:05.721 --> 00:04:08.554
(Promise sobbing)

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:15.250
- Do you wanna sit and do this with me?

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.225
Can she sit here with me?

00:04:16.225 --> 00:04:17.850
- You can do anything
you want, it's my show.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.947
(crowd cheering louder)

00:04:20.947 --> 00:04:22.830
- Sure, she'll sit right here.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:25.080
You can scoot down just
a little bit Promise.

00:04:26.357 --> 00:04:29.280
- I saw your video, and I was so moved.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:33.050
Because your hair is an
extension of your legacy,

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.700
what you come from, your story,

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.220
and everything that you
are, and your beauty.

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:40.950
And I'm so glad that
you knew at 10 years old

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.890
what it took me so long
to learn about myself.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:45.220
And you are such an example.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:46.525
Well done on the parenting.

00:04:46.525 --> 00:04:47.525
- Well done.

00:04:49.573 --> 00:04:50.453
Well done.

00:04:50.453 --> 00:04:53.430
And you're very honest,
like on social media,

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.750
that's what I loved about you, Promise

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.190
