00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.100
She's very honest on social media.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:00.460
You don't hide anything,
you're very proud of your body,

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.730
your hair, where you
come from, everything,

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.530
and I think that that's a beautiful thing,

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.560
and it's such a beautiful,
look how much you touch people.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.393
- Thank you.

00:05:06.393 --> 00:05:07.310
- Your hair looks gorgeous today, too.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:08.718
Look at this.
- Thank you.

00:05:08.718 --> 00:05:10.842
(crowd cheering)

00:05:10.842 --> 00:05:12.040
- I like the braids, too.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.070
Promise, do you want
to say anything to her?

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:15.210
All these women that stand up

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.840
