00:05:54.045 --> 00:05:56.403
- First of all, first of all,

00:05:56.403 --> 00:05:58.460
I would die for that body!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.580
You look so great in that video,

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.110
